Growing and playing together,

17
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:34,000
Happy May Deer and Chuan-Chuan!

18
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,333
ODEER MAYO / Happy May Deer and Chuan-Chuan

19
00:00:37,676 --> 00:00:40,082
Afraid of Going to the Doctor

20
00:00:40,667 --> 00:00:44,167
May and Chuan-Chuan were walking home from school together.

21
00:00:44,167 --> 00:00:46,333
Chuan-Chuan, it’s almost vacation! Aren’t you happy?

22
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:50,000
Hey, what’s wrong?

23
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,750
You don’t look happy.

24
00:00:52,083 --> 00:00:54,583
Because I have to go to the doctor tomorrow, even though it’s a day off.

25
00:00:54,917 --> 00:00:57,083
B-but I don’t want to go.

26
00:00:57,833 --> 00:00:59,417
Hmm. Why not?

27
00:00:59,667 --> 00:01:02,333
The doctor always gives me cute stickers.

28
00:01:02,333 --> 00:01:04,167
Didn’t you get one?

29
00:01:04,583 --> 00:01:06,333
Y-yes, I did.

30
00:01:06,917 --> 00:01:09,500
But I’m still scared.

31
00:01:10,083 --> 00:01:11,583
Oh, I see.

32
00:01:12,333 --> 00:01:13,333
Let me think…

33
00:01:13,583 --> 00:01:14,750
Oh, I’ve got an idea!

34
00:01:15,083 --> 00:01:17,417
I’ll be the doctor, so you won’t be scared.

35
00:01:17,417 --> 00:01:19,417
Ha! That’s a great idea!

36
00:01:19,583 --> 00:01:20,500
I’ll get ready.

37
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:21,417
See you in a bit!

38
00:01:21,417 --> 00:01:22,083
May!

39
00:01:23,667 --> 00:01:26,917
As soon as Chuan-Chuan got home, the doorbell rang.

40
00:01:28,333 --> 00:01:30,167
Hi! Dr. May is here!

41
00:01:30,917 --> 00:01:34,250
Look! I brought a nurse’s hat and my medical kit.

42
00:01:34,417 --> 00:01:35,833
The hospital is open!

43
00:01:42,083 --> 00:01:43,583
Welcome to May’s Hospital!

44
00:01:43,750 --> 00:01:46,333
I’m Dr. May. Patient Number One, please come in.

45
00:01:46,333 --> 00:01:48,417
Uh…

46
00:01:48,667 --> 00:01:51,167
Patient, what seems to be the problem today?

47
00:01:52,917 --> 00:01:55,000
I’m afraid of going to the doctor.

48
00:01:55,333 --> 00:01:56,417
Don’t worry.

49
00:01:56,417 --> 00:01:58,833
Today is just a regular checkup. There’s nothing to be afraid of.

50
00:01:59,167 --> 00:02:00,917
First, let’s take your temperature.

51
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,417
Good. Five kilograms. No fever.

52
00:02:05,667 --> 00:02:08,417
Next, we’ll measure your height. Stand up straight!

53
00:02:11,917 --> 00:02:12,917
Vroom-vroom needs to be measured, too!

54
00:02:24,167 --> 00:02:24,750
Good.

55
00:02:24,750 --> 00:02:25,833
Your weight…

56
00:02:26,667 --> 00:02:29,250
Okay, next is the eye test.

57
00:02:29,333 --> 00:02:30,750
Cover one eye, please.

58
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:36,500
How about this one?

59
00:02:41,083 --> 00:02:41,417
Mm-hmm.

60
00:02:41,583 --> 00:02:43,250
Good. Four-point-zero. No nearsightedness.

61
00:02:43,583 --> 00:02:45,000
Great! The checkup is all done.

62
00:02:45,250 --> 00:02:47,000
You and Vroom-vroom are both very healthy.

63
00:02:47,333 --> 00:02:49,333
Congratulations! You’ve earned a good-patient sticker.

64
00:02:49,917 --> 00:02:51,583
Are you still afraid of going to the doctor?

65
00:02:52,083 --> 00:02:54,500
I-I’m still scared.

66
00:02:54,667 --> 00:02:55,917
Hmm. Why?

67
00:02:56,667 --> 00:02:57,500
Because I…

68
00:02:57,750 --> 00:02:59,583
I’m afraid of getting shots.

69
00:03:00,083 --> 00:03:01,417
Oh, I see.

70
00:03:01,417 --> 00:03:04,000
Getting a shot feels like being stung by a bee. I’m scared of that, too.

71
00:03:04,667 --> 00:03:05,917
But I have a special trick.

72
00:03:06,333 --> 00:03:08,833
You can close your eyes and use your imagination.

73
00:03:09,083 --> 00:03:10,250
It really works!

74
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:12,750
Imagination?

75
00:03:12,750 --> 00:03:15,333
Let’s imagine the needle is…

76
00:03:15,333 --> 00:03:19,250
Miss Unicorn, the guardian of health, who lives in the Rainbow World.

77
00:03:19,417 --> 00:03:23,500
When she bows to you, her horn gently touches you.

78
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:27,583
Her horn is magical. It gives you health and courage!

79
00:03:27,583 --> 00:03:32,250
Wow! Unicorn magic sounds amazing!

80
00:03:32,250 --> 00:03:34,750
All right. I’ll give it a try.

81
00:03:35,750 --> 00:03:38,000
The next day, Chuan-Chuan went to the doctor.

82
00:03:38,333 --> 00:03:40,083
Next patient, Chuan-Chuan!

83
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:45,083
Haha, it’s okay.

84
00:03:45,083 --> 00:03:46,333
Take a deep breath.

85
00:03:46,333 --> 00:03:47,917
There’s no need to be so nervous.

86
00:03:48,250 --> 00:03:50,167
I-I don’t want to go.

87
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:54,083
Avoiding it won’t solve the problem.

88
00:03:58,333 --> 00:04:00,833
Chuan-Chuan, you’ll have to face it eventually.

89
00:04:01,083 --> 00:04:01,750
Come on. Let’s go.

90
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:11,083
Hello, little one. I’m Dr. Pug.

91
00:04:11,083 --> 00:04:13,000
We’re doing your regular checkup today.

92
00:04:14,917 --> 00:04:15,750
Mm-hmm.

93
00:04:23,667 --> 00:04:25,250
You’re very healthy.

94
00:04:26,750 --> 00:04:28,583
All right, the only thing left is your vaccination.

95
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:30,667
Let’s help your body build up its defenses. Woof!

96
00:04:32,917 --> 00:04:35,417
Come on, hold out your arm.

97
00:04:35,417 --> 00:04:35,750
Hurry up.

98
00:04:41,333 --> 00:04:45,250
Uh… Imagination Unicorn!

99
00:04:45,833 --> 00:04:48,333
The unicorn is about to cast her spell!

100
00:04:48,333 --> 00:04:52,667
Oh no! I don’t even know what a unicorn looks like!

101
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,333
Is it like this?

102
00:04:54,333 --> 00:04:54,750
Like a crocodile?

103
00:04:56,917 --> 00:04:59,667
Is her horn round, pointy, or square?

104
00:05:04,833 --> 00:05:06,583
Her horn touched me!

105
00:05:08,250 --> 00:05:10,333
Give me health and courage!

106
00:05:10,333 --> 00:05:11,500
It doesn’t hurt at all!

107
00:05:18,083 --> 00:05:19,333
All done!

108
00:05:22,250 --> 00:05:24,167
It really didn’t hurt!

109
00:05:24,167 --> 00:05:26,167
Your skin is really tough!

110
00:05:26,917 --> 00:05:27,917
Is the shot over?

111
00:05:29,583 --> 00:05:30,833
There’s one more.

112
00:05:31,917 --> 00:05:33,583
Hehe, don’t be nervous.

113
00:05:33,583 --> 00:05:36,167
This shot is to give Vroom-vroom a boost!

114
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,667
Vroom-vroom, say thank you to the doctor.

115
00:05:39,667 --> 00:05:41,500
Now you’re both healthy!

116
00:05:41,500 --> 00:05:43,667
Remember to bring it for a checkup next time. Woof!

117
00:05:44,167 --> 00:05:44,917
Mm-hmm.

118
00:05:44,917 --> 00:05:47,667
Going to the doctor isn’t scary at all!

119
00:05:47,667 --> 00:05:50,833
Hahahaha!
